-- External Sender --

 Share Athletes Data

Description:

The API endpoint allows to get athletes' test information. It is possible t=
o use different filters in request parameters, like a user ID or email addr=
ess, athlete ID, sport ID, and start/end dates.

URL: https://{{inscyd_host}}/api/external/athlete/all_data/

Method: GET

DATA / PARAMS

Header:

X-Api-Key: String

Request parameters:

user_id: <<number>>  // integer
user_email: <<user email>>  // string
sport_id: <<number>>  // integer
athlete_display_id: <<number>>  // integer
start_date: <<iso date, for instance: 2025-01-01T00:00:00>>  // string; onl=
y return results from this date forwards
end_date: <<iso date, for instance: 2025-01-31T00:00:00>>  // string; only =
return results up to this date
id: <<number>>  // integer; Athlete ID (deprecated parameter)
email: <<athlete email>>  // string; (deprecated parameter)

Response body parameters:

  *   Structure

{
  "count": "<integer>",
  "next": "<uri>",
  "previous": "<uri>",
  "page_size": "<integer>",
  "total_pages": "<integer>",
  "results": [
    {
      "athlete_display_id": "<integer>",
      "first_name": "<string>",
      "id": "<integer>",
      "last_name": "<string>",
      "sport_id": "<integer>",
      "created_at": "<dateTime>",
      "vo2max": "<double>",
      "vlamax": "<double>",
      "anaerobic_threshold": "<double>",
      "anaerobic_threshold_absolute": "<double>",
      "fatmax": "<double>",
      "fatmax_power": "<double>",
